    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I check a web design business name is free?",
        "answer": "Press Check on any name to see whether it's free as a company, a domain and a social media handle. In the UK, search Companies House; in the US, search your state's business register and the USPTO trade mark search. Check your local area too, as two similar names nearby confuse customers."
      },
      {
        "question": "Should my web design business name match my domain?",
        "answer": "Yes, as closely as you can: clients will judge you by your own website first. Choose a name that's short, easy to spell when read aloud and has no hyphens, then check the .com and your country's domain (.co.uk in the UK) before you print anything. If the exact domain is taken, adding \"web\", \"studio\" or your town to the domain is fine."
      }
